sequenceDiagram
    participant TestService
    participant EventHub as TestExecutionEventHub
    participant Frontend as Trails Frontend
    participant Logs

    TestService->>TestService: Execute asynchronous test task
    TestService--xTestService: Exception during execution
    TestService->>Logs: Log failure with stack trace
    TestService->>EventHub: publish test.failed
    EventHub-->>Frontend: Failed terminal event
    Frontend-->>Frontend: Show failed execution state
